# SolNeutral V2 | Research preview (no custody, signing or trading)
# Optional PRIVATE RPC URL for the read-only Wallet Lens.
# Mainnet only. Store provider API keys as Vercel environment variables.
# Do NOT prefix this with NEXT_PUBLIC_ (would expose your key in browser builds).
# SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://your-private-mainnet-rpc-provider.example/?api-key=YOUR_KEY
# With this unset, public https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com is attempted;
# it may rate-limit or reject requests. Missing observations will show unavailable.
